"""/*
 * Two facts, never split. `auto-fit` on the list above yields four columns at
 * desktop width, which put "opens" at the end of one row and "closes" alone on
 * the next; a two-column maximum keeps the pair legible as a pair at every width
 * that fits them, and stacks them at phone width like everything else.
